    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>When present, aberrant HMGA2 expression is a useful diagnostic marker for deep (aggressive) angiomyxoma. It is particularly helpful in defining the margin of the tumour, because non-neoplastic mesenchyme lacks expression.</p>",
